ion/Trees/RootedTree":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RootedTree"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RootedTree"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trees\/rootedtree","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/RootedTree","title":"RootedTree","abstract":[{"text":"A tree with a root: an undirected ","type":"text"},{"code":"Graph","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with ","type":"text"},{"code":"root","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"parent(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"children(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"depth(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and the queries tree algorithms start from. The vertices, edges and their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"positions are the tree’s; the root orders "},{"code":"children(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (each vertex’s incident edges in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"position order, without the edge to its parent) and so "},{"code":"preorder","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"doc://TreeAlgorithms/documentation/TreeAlgorithms":{"title":"TreeAlgorithms","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/treealgorithms","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TreeAlgorithms\/documentation\/TreeAlgorithms","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol"}}}